.TH strarray_copy 3
.SH NAME
strarray_copy \- copy a string array
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "strarray.h"
.PP
.BI "int strarray_copy(strarray *" dst ", const strarray *" src ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B strarray_copy
creates a deep copy of the string array
.I src
into
.IR dst .
Each string element is duplicated using
.BR str_dup (3).
Returns 1 on success, 0 on failure.